  <ThingDef ParentName="AnimalThingBase">
    <defName>RM_SumpMouse</defName>
    <label>sump-mouse</label>
    <description>A palm-sized silver-grey mouse on absurdly broad, splayed snowshoe feet, its coat beaded with shed oil. A sump-mouse is never alone and never wandering — they move in lines, and the lines are the map: a stretch of black no line crosses is something's back, an unbroken pale crust no line touches is a lie. Junkers read them the way sailors read water. Cheap to keep and eager to be kept — a caged line of them is a living tar-detector.</description>
    <statBases>
      <MoveSpeed>5.6</MoveSpeed>
      <MarketValue>15</MarketValue>
      <ComfyTemperatureMin>-40</ComfyTemperatureMin>
      <Wildness>0.25</Wildness>
      <!-- RULED, question card 2026-09-24: tameable, cheap and easy. Low
           Wildness is what TameUtility actually reads for tame difficulty. -->
    </statBases>
    <tools>
      <li>
        <label>left claw</label>
        <labelNoLocation>claw</labelNoLocation>
        <capacities>
          <li>Scratch</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>3</power>
        <cooldownTime>2</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>FrontLeftPaw</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
      </li>
      <li>
        <label>right claw</label>
        <labelNoLocation>claw</labelNoLocation>
        <capacities>
          <li>Scratch</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>3</power>
        <cooldownTime>2</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>FrontRightPaw</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
      </li>
      <li>
        <capacities>
          <li>Bite</li>
        </capacities>
        <power>4</power>
        <cooldownTime>2</cooldownTime>
        <linkedBodyPartsGroup>Teeth</linkedBodyPartsGroup>
        <chanceFactor>0.7</chanceFactor>
      </li>
    </tools>
    <race>
      <body>QuadrupedAnimalWithPawsAndTail</body>
      <baseBodySize>0.15</baseBodySize>
